		<title>The CINEMETROPOLIS Listening Party, part 1</title>
		<link>http://bluescholars.com/blog/the-cinemetropolis-listening-party-part-1/</link>
		<comments>http://bluescholars.com/blog/the-cinemetropolis-listening-party-part-1/#comments</comments>
		<pubDate>Mon, 14 Mar 2011 20:28:46 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator>Geo</dc:creator>
				<category><![CDATA[Cinemetropolis]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[photos]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Blue Scholars]]></category>
