		<category><![CDATA[Seattle]]></category>

		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://02cd02a.netsolhost.com/blog/?p=2924</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[A couple Sundays ago, we unveiled the 15 new tracks off Cinemetropolis at a listening party with fam in Seattle.]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a rel="attachment wp-att-2932" href="http://02cd02a.netsolhost.com/blog/the-cinemetropolis-listening-party-part-1/ee5ce53/"><img class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-2932" title="ee5ce53" src="http://02cd02a.netsolhost.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2011/03/ee5ce53-500x333.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="333" /></a></p>
<p>A couple Sundays ago, we unveiled the 15 new tracks off <strong>Cinemetropolis</strong> at a listening party with fam in Seattle. It was a homecoming and reunion for us, as it was held at the <strong>Theater Off Jackson</strong> upstairs room, formerly the old <strong>Wing Luke Asian Museum,</strong> where I worked from 2002-2006 &#8212; the first four years of Blue Scholars&#8217;s existence. It was there that we finally announced <a href="http://bluescholars.com/cinemetropolis/">who we decided to sign with for our next record</a>, officially launching the Cinemetropolis campaign with new music and videos to drop in the weeks leading up to the album&#8217;s May digital release and June physical release.</p>
<p>Shoutout to <a href="http://gregoryniss.tumblr.com/">Greg Nissen</a>, who took these filthy photos (except, of course, the one he&#8217;s in at the bottom of this page). Hit up <a href="http://gregoryniss.tumblr.com/">Greg&#8217;s tumblr</a> for more photos from the listening party and check out what <a href="http://www.guerrillacandy.com/2011/03/07/first-listen-blue-scholars-cinematropolis/">Guerilla Candy</a>, <a href="http://www.ssgmusic.com/this-is-just-us-and-you-guys-blue-scholars-begin-kickstarter-campaign-for-cinemetropolis/">Seattle Show Gal</a>, and <a href="http://lineout.thestranger.com/lineout/archives/2011/03/08/blue-scholars-prep-cinematropolis-sign-to-the-people">The Stranger</a> have to say bout the party and first impressions of the new record.</p>
<p><a rel="attachment wp-att-2934" href="http://02cd02a.netsolhost.com/blog/the-cinemetropolis-listening-party-part-1/fd685f4-1/"><img class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-2934" title="fd685f4-1" src="http://02cd02a.netsolhost.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2011/03/fd685f4-1-500x352.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="352" /></a></p>
