<p>Running out of hours/cash to get something for that special someone for the holidays? Or don&#8217;t particularly observe nor care about the holidays but are down for some free music? Suffice to say, we&#8217;ve got the solution. Click the&#8230; <a href="http://bluescholars.com/blog/m%e2%88%86deinheights-presents-winter-pigeons/" class="read_more">More</a></p>]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="http://madeinheights.bandcamp.com"><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-2787" title="madeinheights" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/tumblr_ldxbreMrJH1qdu03zo1_500.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="500" /></a></p>
<p>Running out of hours/cash to get something for that special someone for the holidays? Or don&#8217;t particularly observe nor care about the holidays but are down for some free music? Suffice to say, we&#8217;ve got the solution. Click the image above for a free download of <em>Winter Pigeons (Songs To Raise Your Dead Spirits)</em>, the four-song debut EP by <strong>::M∆DE::IN::HEIGHTS::</strong>, <strong>Sabzi</strong>&#8216;s new project in collaboration with vocalist <strong>Kelsey</strong>. As Sabzi wrote on <a href="http://townfo.lk">townfo.lk</a>,</p>
<blockquote><p>a little while ago my friend Kelsey and I started talking about forming a group together and making some music.  last week it finally happened for really real sugar hill mint&#8217;n'dill when we got together in SEA and knocked out a little EP in time to offer it to you all as a seasonal gift.</p></blockquote>
<p>It describes itself as pop, filth, and New York; we&#8217;ll let you decipher the rest on your own. (NB: Definitely keep the <a href="http://madeinheights.tumblr.com">::M∆DE::IN::HEIGHTS:: tumblr</a> handy as you listen along.) Enjoy, and do let us know what you think.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
